---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<Layout
    title="Terms of Service - Remote Mouse Jiggler"
    description="Terms of Service for Remote Mouse Jiggler Android application by heymeowcat."
>
    <div class="container content-container">
        <div class="policy-header">
            <a href={`${base}/`} class="back-link">&larr; Back to Home</a>
            <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="last-updated">
                Last updated: {
                    new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
                        month: "long",
                        day: "numeric",
                        year: "numeric",
                    })
                }
            </p>
        </div>

        <section class="policy-section intro-card">
            <p>
                By downloading, installing, or using the <strong>Remote Mouse Jiggler</strong> application ("the App"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use the application.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>1. License & Permitted Use</h2>
            <p>
                heymeowcat grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use Remote Mouse Jiggler on compatible Android devices for personal and legitimate operational purposes.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>2. User Responsibility & Compliance</h2>
            <p>
                You are solely responsible for how you utilize the input controls and automated mouse jiggling features of this application:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Workplace & Organizational Policies:</strong> You are responsible for ensuring that your use of automated input tools complies with your employer's, organization's, or institution's IT policies, security protocols, and employment agreements.</li>
                <li><strong>Lawful Use:</strong> You agree not to use the App for any unlawful, deceptive, or unauthorized activities that violate applicable local, national, or international laws.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>3. Hardware & Bluetooth Compatibility</h2>
            <p>
                Remote Mouse Jiggler utilizes standard Bluetooth Human Interface Device (HID) profiles supported by Android. However, hardware compatibility depends on your Android device's Bluetooth chipset, manufacturer firmware, and the target host device (PC, Mac, TV, or Linux system). We do not guarantee uninterrupted compatibility with every third-party operating system, Bluetooth adapter, or hardware configuration.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p>
                The Remote Mouse Jiggler name, logo, visual artwork, designs, and proprietary source code are the intellectual property of heymeowcat. Open-source components are subject to their respective open-source licenses (such as the Apache License 2.0).
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
            <p>
                The application is provided on an <strong>"AS IS"</strong> and <strong>"AS AVAILABLE"</strong> basis, without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>
                To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, heymeowcat and its developers shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or exemplary damages arising from your use or inability to use the application.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>7. Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                Your privacy is paramount. Please review our <a href={`${base}/privacy-policy`}>Privacy Policy</a> for complete details on our zero data collection practices.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>8. Changes to Terms</h2>
            <p>
                We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the application following any changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
            <h2>9. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>
                For questions regarding these Terms of Service, please reach out to:
            </p>
            <p class="contact-email">
                <a href="mailto:support@heymeowcat.is-a.dev">support@heymeowcat.is-a.dev</a>
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .content-container {
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem 2rem;
        max-width: 800px;
    }

    .policy-header {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .back-link {
        display: inline-block;
        color: var(--primary);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.75rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .last-updated {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--text-dim);
    }

    .policy-section {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .intro-card {
        background: var(--bg-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-highlight);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-main);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
    }

    ul {
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    li {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    li strong {
        color: var(--text-main);
    }

    a {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .contact-email a {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
</style>
